### =============================================================================
### DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT TESTS - API Gateway (Port 4000)
### =============================================================================

### 1. Upload Document (Owner - Student)
POST http://localhost:4000/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

{{application_id}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

CV and Cover Letter
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cv_cover_letter.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
This is a sample PDF content for testing.
This would be actual PDF binary data in real usage.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

