### =============================================================================
### LIST DOCUMENTS
### =============================================================================

### 9. List Documents (Owner)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents?application_id={{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 10. List Documents (Admin)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents?application_id={{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 11. List Documents (Encadrant)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents?application_id={{application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{encadrant_token}}

### 12. List Documents (Not Owner - Should Fail)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents?application_id={{other_user_application_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 13. List Documents (Missing Application ID)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 14. List Documents (Invalid Application ID)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents?application_id=invalid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 15. List Documents (Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:4000/documents?application_id={{application_id}}

